<title>USA: BEFORE THE BELL - Dell up on Q1 EPS, split.</title>
<headline>BEFORE THE BELL - Dell up on Q1 EPS, split.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dell Computer Corp shares extended recent gains preceding Wednesday's U.S. market open on buying powered by the computer maker's above-expectation first quarter results.</p>
<p>Traders said Dell climbed to 104 in early third market trade, up from 99-5/8 at Tuesday's Nasdaq close and 101-1/4 reach in Tuesday after-hours activity.</p>
<p>Dell said after Tuesday's market close it earned $1.08 per share in the quarter ended May 4, exceeding a Wall Street consensus estimate of $0.93 and up from $0.42 a year ago.</p>
